#: kwindecoration.cpp:66
msgid "Window Decoration"
msgstr "Fenestro-aspkekto"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:67
msgid ""
"Select the window decoration. This is the look and feel of both the window "
"borders and the window handle."
msgstr ""
"Elektu la fenestro-aspekton. Tio estas la aspekto kaj konduto de la fenstrorandoj kaj "
"la tenilo."

#: kwindecoration.cpp:71
msgid "General options (if available)"
msgstr "Ĝeneralaj opcioj (se ekzistas)"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:72
msgid "Use custom titlebar button &positions"
msgstr "Uzu &proprajn lokojn en la titollistelo"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:73
msgid ""
"The appropriate settings can be found in the \"Buttons\"-Tab. Please note "
"that this option is not available on all styles yet!"
msgstr ""
"La koncerna agordo troviĝas sur la paĝo \"Butonoj\". Bonvolu noti, ke "
"tiu opcio ne jam estas uzebla en ĉiuj stiloj!"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:84
msgid "Titlebar Button Position"
msgstr "Loko de la titollistelaj butonoj"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:88
msgid ""
"To add or remove titlebar buttons, simply <i>drag</i> items between the "
"available item list and the titlebar preview. Similarly, drag items within "
"the titlebar preview to re-position them."
msgstr ""

#: kwindecoration.cpp:106
msgid "&General"
msgstr "Ĝ&enerale"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:107
msgid "&Buttons"
msgstr "&Butonoj"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:167
msgid "KDE2 default"
msgstr "KDE2-apriora"

#: kwindecoration.cpp:267
msgid ""
"<H3>No Configurable Options Available</H3>Sorry, no configurable options are "
"available for the current decoration."
msgstr ""

#: kwindecoration.cpp:410
msgid ""
"<h1>Window Manager Decoration</h1>This module allows you to choose the "
"window border decorations, as well as titlebar button positions and custom "
"decoration options."
msgstr ""

